    },
    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\"><span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"2\">Level 2 - Beginner</span><span class=\"time\">20 min</span><span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Grid flood fill</span><a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/max-area-of-island/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 695</a></div>\n  <h1>Max Area of Island</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Insight in one line: every island is a connected component of land cells, so scan the grid and, at each unvisited land cell, flood-fill its whole island while counting cells; mark cells as you reach them so each is counted once. O(rows &times; cols) time.</p>\n"
